   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>As far as I can tell tarkov changed the way thermals interact with optics and therefor old fixes like in <a href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/87-t-7-friendly-dot/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">T-7 Friendly DOT</a> sadly no longer work.</p>\n<p>I am still looking at possible fixes but as of right now I can only scale down the glass so you have a small black dot reticle but all scopes with zoom are out of the question right now</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
   "likes": 0
